<Slide style={{ background: "#0B1220", padding: "44px 72px", display: "flex", flexDirection: "column" }}>
  <Text style={{ color: "#6B7280", fontSize: 14, letterSpacing: 3 }}>核心能力</Text>
  <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 700, marginTop: 10 }}>意图理解：规则优先，模型兜底</Text>

  <Box style={{ display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", gap: 36, marginTop: 32 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1.2, display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: "rgba(34,197,94,0.08)", border: "1px solid rgba(34,197,94,0.4)", borderRadius: 12, padding: "22px 22px" }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#22C55E", fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 700 }}>第一层　规则匹配</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 8 }}>十一条意图规则覆盖六类常见表述，一条规则可派生多个工具意图。中英文数字金额一并归一，单轮解析耗时一毫秒内，结果确定可复现。</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#6B7280", fontSize: 15, marginTop: 12 }}>「转给小王 500」「给房东下周转 3000 房租」都能直接落到工具与槽位。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: "rgba(59,130,246,0.08)", border: "1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.4)", borderRadius: 12, padding: "22px 22px" }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#93C5FD", fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 700 }}>第二层　模型兜底</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 10 }}>规则没命中才请模型解析，输出受契约约束：工具名、槽位、置信度、理由。越界工具名或非法槽位值直接丢弃。</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#6B7280", fontSize: 15, marginTop: 12 }}>响应零点六至零点九秒，失败时回落到追问，不猜。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: "rgba(107,114,128,0.12)", border: "1px solid rgba(107,114,128,0.4)", borderRadius: 12, padding: "22px 22px" }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#D1D5DB", fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 700 }}>第三层　缺槽追问</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 10 }}>槽位不全不执行。少金额就问金额，少收款人就问收款人，追问结果回填后重走判定流程。</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#6B7280", fontSize: 15, marginTop: 12 }}>体验官只提建议，不改判定，问句由编排层统一生成。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: "rgba(11,18,32,0.6)", border: "1px solid #374151", borderRadius: 12, padding: "22px 22px", display: "flex", flexDirection: "column" }}>
      <Text style={{ color: "#6B7280", fontSize: 14, letterSpacing: 2 }}>一次解析的输出</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#22C55E", fontSize: 15, marginTop: 16, fontFamily: "Consolas, monospace" }}>意图：智能转账</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#F59E0B", fontSize: 15, marginTop: 8, fontFamily: "Consolas, monospace" }}>工具：transfer</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#93C5FD", fontSize: 15, marginTop: 8, fontFamily: "Consolas, monospace" }}>收款人：小王</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 15, marginTop: 8, fontFamily: "Consolas, monospace" }}>金额：50000 分</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 15, marginTop: 8, fontFamily: "Consolas, monospace" }}>置信度：0.96</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#6B7280", fontSize: 15, marginTop: 8, fontFamily: "Consolas, monospace" }}>理由：出现「转给」与金额</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#6B7280", fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 18 }}>金额一律用整数分存储，避免浮点误差。理由与置信度一起落审计，出错时能回看是哪一步判的。</Text>
      <Box style={{ borderTop: "1px solid #243044", marginTop: 16, paddingTop: 14, display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#D1D5DB", fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>槽位缺失时输出 missing 列表，编排层据此追问。</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#D1D5DB", fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>置信度低于阈值时同样走追问，不猜金额。</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#D1D5DB", fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>每次解析的耗时与来源一并记录，便于对比规则与模型的表现。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
